---
import { GISCUS } from '../consts';

const enabled = GISCUS.enabled && GISCUS.repo && GISCUS.repoId && GISCUS.categoryId;
---

<section class="comments" aria-labelledby="comments-title">
  <h2 class="comments__title" id="comments-title">评论</h2>

  {
    enabled ? (
      <div
        class="giscus"
        data-repo={GISCUS.repo}
        data-repo-id={GISCUS.repoId}
        data-category={GISCUS.category}
        data-category-id={GISCUS.categoryId}
        data-mapping={GISCUS.mapping}
        data-strict={GISCUS.strict}
        data-reactions-enabled={GISCUS.reactionsEnabled}
        data-input-position={GISCUS.inputPosition}
        data-lang={GISCUS.lang}
        data-theme="light"
        data-loading="lazy"
      />
    ) : (
      <div class="comments__placeholder">
        <p><strong>评论功能尚未启用。</strong>这里预留了 Giscus 的位置，基于 GitHub Discussions，静态站点也能有评论。</p>
        <p>开启方式：</p>
        <ol>
          <li>新建一个公开仓库，在 Settings → Features 中勾选 Discussions</li>
          <li>安装 giscus app，并给仓库授权</li>
          <li>打开 giscus.app 填写仓库，复制 repoId 和 categoryId</li>
          <li>填入 <code>src/consts.ts</code> 的 <code>GISCUS</code>，把 <code>enabled</code> 改成 true</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    )
  }
</section>

{
  enabled && (
    <script is:inline>
      (() => {
        const script = document.createElement('script');
        script.src = 'https://giscus.app/client.js';
        script.async = true;
        script.crossOrigin = 'anonymous';

        const el = document.querySelector('.giscus');
        if (!el) return;
        for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(el.dataset)) {
          const name = 'data-' + key.replace(/[A-Z]/g, (c) => '-' + c.toLowerCase());
          script.setAttribute(name, value);
        }
        if (document.documentElement.dataset.theme === 'dark') {
          script.setAttribute('data-theme', 'dark_dimmed');
        }
        el.replaceWith(script);

        const themes = { light: 'light', dark: 'dark_dimmed' };
        const apply = (mode) => {
          const frame = document.querySelector('iframe.giscus-frame');
          if (!frame) return;
          frame.contentWindow?.postMessage(
            { giscus: { setConfig: { theme: themes[mode] || 'light' } } },
            'https://giscus.app'
          );
        };
        document.addEventListener('themechange', (e) => apply(e.detail));
      })();
    </script>
  )
}
